WEBVTT

00:00:28.615 --> 00:00:30.102
I zašto od seksa nastaju bebe,

00:00:30.102 --> 00:00:34.215
a bebe izazivaju
erotsku katastrofu kod parova?

00:00:34.215 --> 00:00:36.902
Kao neki fatalni
erotski udarac, zar ne?

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:39.351
A kada volite,
kakav je to osećaj?

00:00:39.351 --> 00:00:42.504
A kada žudite,
koliko je to drugačije?

00:00:42.504 --> 00:00:44.172
To su neka od pitanja

00:00:44.172 --> 00:00:46.760
u središtu mog istraživanja

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.512
o prirodi erotske žudnje

00:00:49.512 --> 00:00:53.510
i dilemama u vezi sa time
u savremenoj ljubavi.

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.312
Putujem svetom

00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:57.506
i primećujem da

00:00:57.506 --> 00:01:00.467
tamo gde je stupila romantika